{"seq":2,"slug":"pharmacogenomics-dosing","title":"博士临床研究 — 药物基因组学与个体化给药","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/clinical-research-advanced/precision-medicine/pharmacogenomics-dosing","wordCount":1867,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"博士临床研究-药物基因组学与个体化给药\">博士临床研究 — 药物基因组学与个体化给药</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>药物基因组学（Pharmacogenomics, PGx）研究遗传变异如何影响个体对药物的反应——包括疗效、毒性和代谢速率。将基因型信息整合到给药决策中，可以实现从&quot;一刀切&quot;标准剂量向基于个体遗传特征的精确给药转变。临床药物基因组学实施联盟（CPIC）已为超过 25 种药物-基因对发布了循证给药指南，覆盖心血管、肿瘤、精神科和镇痛等领域。</p>\n<p>药物基因组学的作用层次：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>药物代谢酶多态性</strong>：CYP2D6、CYP2C19、CYP2C9 等细胞色素 P450 酶的遗传变异导致代谢速率差异。根据代谢能力可将患者分为超快代谢者（UM）、正常代谢者（NM）、中间代谢者（IM）和慢代谢者（PM）</li>\n<li><strong>药物转运体变异</strong>：ABCB1（P-糖蛋白）、OATP1B1 等转运体的多态性影响药物分布和清除</li>\n<li><strong>药效靶点变异</strong>：VKORC1 变异影响华法林敏感性，DPYD 变异影响氟尿嘧啶毒性</li>\n<li><strong>免疫相关变异</strong>：HLA 基因型与严重药物超敏反应的关联（如 HLA-B*5701 与阿巴卡韦）</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[基因型检测] --&gt; B{代谢表型}&#10;    B --&gt;|UM 超快代谢| C[前药: 增效&lt;br/&gt;活性药: 减效]&#10;    B --&gt;|NM 正常代谢| D[标准剂量]&#10;    B --&gt;|IM 中间代谢| E[减量或换药]&#10;    B --&gt;|PM 慢代谢| F[大幅减量&lt;br/&gt;或禁忌]&#10;    C --&gt; G[个体化给药方案]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    A[基因型检测] --&gt; B{代谢表型}\n    B --&gt;|UM 超快代谢| C[前药: 增效&lt;br/&gt;活性药: 减效]\n    B --&gt;|NM 正常代谢| D[标准剂量]\n    B --&gt;|IM 中间代谢| E[减量或换药]\n    B --&gt;|PM 慢代谢| F[大幅减量&lt;br/&gt;或禁忌]\n    C --&gt; G[个体化给药方案]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"cyp450-酶系统与活性评分\">CYP450 酶系统与活性评分</h3><p>CYP2D6 是药物基因组学中研究最深入的基因之一，参与约 25% 的处方药物代谢。其显著特点是等位基因数量众多（&gt;130 个已命名等位基因）和拷贝数变异（基因扩增导致超快代谢）。</p>\n<p>CPIC 采用活性评分（Activity Score, AS）系统标准化代谢表型分配：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等位基因功能</th>\n<th>活性值</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正常功能</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td>*1, *2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能降低</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>*9, *10, *41</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无功能</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>*3, *4, *5, *6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能增加</td>\n<td>&gt;1.0</td>\n<td>*1×N, *2×N（基因扩增）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个等位基因的 AS 相加得到总 AS，据此分配代谢表型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AS</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>AS</mtext><mtext>allele 1</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>AS</mtext><mtext>allele 2</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AS} = \\text{AS}_{\\text{allele 1}} + \\text{AS}_{\\text{allele 2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AS</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">allele 1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">allele 2</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>总 AS</th>\n<th>代谢表型</th>\n<th>临床行动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&gt;2.25</td>\n<td>UM 超快代谢</td>\n<td>可待因: 换药（吗啡生成过多）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.25-2.25</td>\n<td>NM 正常代谢</td>\n<td>标准剂量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.25-1.0</td>\n<td>IM 中间代谢</td>\n<td>他莫昔芬: 考虑换药</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>PM 慢代谢</td>\n<td>可待因: 禁忌（无镇痛效果）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"群体药代动力学与基于模型的精确给药\">群体药代动力学与基于模型的精确给药</h3><p>群体药代动力学（Population PK, PopPK）模型是将基因型信息转化为个体化给药方案的数学框架。非线性混合效应模型（NLMEM）是标准方法：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{ij} = f(\\theta_i, t_{ij}) + \\varepsilon_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>pop</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_i = \\theta_{\\text{pop}} \\cdot \\exp(\\eta_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pop</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是个体参数向量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_i \\sim N(0, \\Omega)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是个体间变异，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_{ij} \\sim N(0, \\Sigma)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是残差变异。</p>\n<p>基因型作为协变量纳入模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>W</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mn>70</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>0.75</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>CYP2D6</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CL_i = \\theta_{CL} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{WT_i}{70}\\right)^{0.75} \\cdot \\theta_{\\text{CYP2D6}} \\cdot \\exp(\\eta_{CL,i})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​<