-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CYP2D6</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>CYP2D6</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\text{CYP2D6}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CYP2D6</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对不同代谢表型取不同值（如 PM=0.5, IM=0.7, NM=1.0, UM=1.5）。</p>\n<p>**贝叶斯 MIPD（Model-Informed Precision Dosing）**结合群体先验和个体治疗药物监测（TDM）数据：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>采集 1-2 个血药浓度样本</li>\n<li>利用群体 PK 模型作为先验分布</li>\n<li>通过 MAP（最大后验概率）估计个体 PK 参数</li>\n<li>基于个体参数预测最优剂量</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mtext>MAP</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>pop</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\theta}_i^{\\text{MAP}} = \\arg\\max_{\\theta_i} \\left[\\ln L(\\mathbf{y}_i | \\theta_i) + \\ln \\pi(\\theta_i | \\theta_{\\text{pop}}, \\Omega)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2049em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MAP</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6022em;vertical-align:-0.8522em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8522em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pop</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"临床实施的关键案例\">临床实施的关键案例</h3><p><strong>华法林给药算法</strong>：</p>\n<p>华法林是 PGx 指导给药研究最多的药物。影响其剂量的主要基因包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CYP2C9</strong>：*2 和 *3 等位基因使酶活性降低 30-80%，需要减量</li>\n<li><strong>VKORC1</strong>：-1639G&gt;A 变异使靶蛋白对华法林更敏感，需要减量</li>\n</ul>\n<p>国际华法林药物基因组学联盟（IWPC）算法整合基因型和临床变量预测稳态剂量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mtext>Dose</mtext></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>5.6044</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.2614</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>Age/10</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>0.0087</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>Height</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>0.0128</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>Weight</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>0.8677</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>VKORC1</mtext><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1.6974</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>CYP2C9</mtext><mrow><mo>∗</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo>∗</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{\\text{Dose}} = 5.6044 - 0.2614 \\times \\text{Age/10} + 0.0087 \\times \\text{Height} + 0.0128 \\times \\text{Weight} - 0.8677 \\times \\text{VKORC1}_{AA} - 1.6974 \\times \\text{CYP2C9}_{*3/*3} + \\cdots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.0645em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9755em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Dose</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0645em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.6044</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2614</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Age/10</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0087</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Height</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0128</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Weight</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8677</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VKORC1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">AA</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.6974</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CYP2C9</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3/</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.313em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>氯吡格雷与 CYP2C19</strong>：</p>\n<p>氯吡格雷是前药，需经 CYP2C19 活化。CYP2C19 PM（*2/*2）患者活性代谢物生成不足，支架内血栓风险显著增加（HR ≈ 2.5-3.0）。CPIC 指南推荐 PM 患者换用替格瑞洛或普拉格雷。</p>\n<p><strong>氟尿嘧啶与 DPYD</strong>：</p>\n<p>DPYD 基因编码二氢嘧啶脱氢酶（DPD），是氟尿嘧啶灭活的限速酶。DPYD 功能缺失变异携带者使用标准剂量可发生致命性毒性（重度粒细胞减少、腹泻、黏膜炎），死亡率可达 10%。EMA（2020）和多个欧洲国家已强制要求氟尿嘧啶类药物使用前进行 DPYD 基因检测。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实施科学挑战\">实施科学挑战</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>详情</th>\n<th>应对策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>种族差异</td>\n<td>等位基因频率在不同人群中差异巨大</td>\n<td>多种族数据库（PharmGKB）、本地化验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检测标准化</td>\n<td>不同实验室使用不同 panel 和报告方式</td>\n<td>ClinGen/CPIC 标准化命名、星号等位基因标准化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>临床决策整合</td>\n<td>基因型结果需嵌入 EHR 工作流</td>\n<td>CDS 规则引擎、FHIR PGx IG</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证据等级</td>\n<td>不是所有药物-基因对都有 RCT 证据</td>\n<td>CPIC 证据分级框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本效益</td>\n<td>预先检测 vs. 反应性检测</td>\n<td>多基因 panel 一次检测终身受益</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一位患者基因型为 CYP2D6 *4/*10（*4 无功能，*10 功能降低）。计算其活性评分，判定代谢表型，并根据 CPIC 指南讨论该患者使用可待因和他莫昔芬时分别需要的剂量调整。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一项前瞻性 RCT 评价 DPYD 基因检测指导氟尿嘧啶给药的临床效用。确定主要终点（安全性 vs. 有效性）、随机化策略（pre-emptive testing vs. standard care）和非劣效性界值的设定逻辑。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某医院拟实施预先基因检测项目（pre-emptive PGx panel），涵盖 12 个药物基因组学基因。讨论该项目的实施路径：检测时机、结果存储（EHR 集成 vs. 独立报告）、临床决策支持系统设计，以及如何处理意外发现（如药物基因组学 panel 中附带发现的疾病风险变异）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>贝叶斯 MIPD 方法要求群体 PK 模型作为先验。若该模型基于西方人群建立，但临床应用于亚洲人群，讨论模型迁移性的评估方法和先验调整策略。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>CPIC Guidelines</strong>（cpicpgx.org）— 药物基因组学临床实施指南的权威来源</li>\n<li><strong>PharmGKB</strong>（pharmgkb.org）— 全球最大的药物基因组学知识库</li>\n<li><strong>Relling &amp; Evans (2015)</strong>：<em>Pharmacogenomics in the clinic</em>（Nature）— 药物基因组学临床应用综述</li>\n<li><strong>Darwich et al. (2017)</strong>：<em>Why has model-informed precision dosing not yet become common clinical reality?</em>（CPT: Pharmacometrics &amp; Systems Pharmacology）</li>\n<li><strong>NONMEM / Monolix</strong>：群体 PK 建模的标准软件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>药物基因组学将遗传信息转化为可操作的给药决策，是精准医学中离临床实践最近的分支。CYP450 酶多态性的活性评分系统、VKORC1/DPYD 等药效靶点变异的剂量算法，以及基于群体 PK 模型的贝叶斯精确给药（MIPD），构成了从基因型到剂量的完整技术链。CPIC 和 DPWG 的循证指南为临床实施提供了标准化路径，而 EHR 集成和预先检测项目的推进正在将药物基因组学从研究工具转变为常规临床实践。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"博士临床研究 — 药物基因组学与个体化给药","id":"博士临床研究-药物基因组学与个体化给药"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"CYP450 酶系统与活性评分","id":"cyp450-酶系统与活性评分"},{"level":3,"text":"群体药代动力学与基于模型的精确给药","id":"群体药代动力学与基于模型的精确给药"},{"level":3,"text":"临床实施的关键案例","id":"临床实施的关键案例"},{"level":3,"text":"实施科学挑战","id":"实施科学挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"博士临床研究 — 生物标志物驱动的试验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/clinical-research-advanced/precision-medicine/biomarker-driven-trials"},"next":{"title":"博士临床研究 — AI 辅助临床决策支持","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/clinical-research-advanced/precision-medicine/ai-clinical-decision-support"}}